- Strictly use valid JSON format (escape special characters like ‘
<br class="ltx_break">‘, ‘"‘, ‘{{}}‘).
- No line breaks or unescaped control characters in step strings.
- Ensure all strings are enclosed in double quotes (‘"‘).
