<span id="A1.SS3.SSSx1.p5.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.SSSx1.p5.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">**Required Elements:**
