<span id="A1.SS3.SSSx1.p5.pic1.2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.SSSx1.p5.pic1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">**Output Format** (Plain text):
"Method: [Framework] using [Theorem1], [Theorem2]. Core operations: [Technique1] with [Constraint2]. Critical steps: [StepSignature1], [StepSignature2]"</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
